se/lean/QOU/Torsion/YekutieliTriple.lean#L67-L67","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.TwistedTwoCocycle","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.TwistedTwoCocycle","kind":"structure","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/YekutieliTriple.lean#L65-L73","doc":"**Twisted 2-cocycle condition**.\nLaTeX: `\\label{prop:descent-condition}` ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.cechDeviation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.cechDeviation","kind":"def","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/YekutieliTriple.lean#L60-L63","doc":"Čech 1-cocycle deviation `g_{ijk}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.YekutieliTriple.twoMorphisms_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.YekutieliTriple.twoMorphisms_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/YekutieliTriple.lean#L56-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.YekutieliTriple.twoMorphisms","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.YekutieliTriple.twoMorphisms","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/YekutieliTriple.lean#L55-L55","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.YekutieliTriple.oneMorphisms","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.YekutieliTriple.oneMorphisms","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/YekutieliTriple.lean#L54-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.YekutieliTriple.objects","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.YekutieliTriple.objects","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/YekutieliTriple.lean#L53-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.YekutieliTriple.level","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.YekutieliTriple.level","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/YekutieliTriple.lean#L52-L52","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.YekutieliTriple.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.YekutieliTriple.mk","kind":"ctor","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/YekutieliTriple.lean#L51-L51","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.YekutieliTriple","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.YekutieliTriple","kind":"structure","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/YekutieliTriple.lean#L41-L56","doc":"**Yekutieli triple** at level `n` over `Uᵢ ∩ Uⱼ`.\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:yekutieli-triple}`\n\nRequires only `[Zero R]`: the triple is *data* plus one non-degeneracy\nhypothesis (`twoMorphisms p ≠ 0`), and nothing in it multiplies or inverts.\nKept deliberately at that minimum so rings **without** total inverses can\ninstantiate it — in particular `R_q = ℤ[q, q⁻¹]`, which\n`QOU.LiftingDescent.CosimplicialCrossedGroupoid` builds its cosimplicial\ntower over. The inverse-using constructions below ask for `GroupWithZero`\nseparately, so the weaker structure is not weakened *for* them. ","signatureChunk":0}]}